// A command made of others (CHAT.md, *Commands*): `run` lists command lines, $1.. are its arguments.
// Commands that code registers (give, tp, heal...) may have a file of their own too, to change how
// they read - usage, summary, aliases, dev - without touching what they do.
{
  summary: "Fills every resource, brings you back, and teaches every skill.",
  dev: true,
  run: ["heal", "learn all"],
}
